WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.499 --> 00:00:02.202
Sorry. Excuse me.

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:08.241
Hello, everybody.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.077
Hello, everybody.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.612
Hello, everyone.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.180
(INDISTINCT CHATTER CONTINUES)

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:15.615
Listen up!

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:22.489
First, I wanna thank you all
for coming here today

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:23.822
to honor my dear Betty.

00:00:24.723 --> 00:00:28.027
(SIGHS) But there's
something else I'd like to say,

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.962
and I gotta get it off my chest.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:33.933
I was gonna tell Betty,
but now it looks like

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:35.268
that isn't gonna happen.

00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:38.004
And I can't live with
this anymore.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.140
I can't live with the guilt.

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:44.144
I had an affair...

00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:47.213
with Helen Fahey.

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:48.614
(SNORTS)

00:00:48.714 --> 00:00:51.051
(COUGHING)

00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:56.556
(LAUGHS)

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:59.192
Listen-- Listen to me.

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:00.993
Affair's a strong word,
very strong.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:02.561
It happened twice.

00:01:02.828 --> 00:01:04.430
(CACKLING)

00:01:04.763 --> 00:01:06.231
Okay, three times, tops.

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:08.467
But, you know, the fact
that I can't even remember

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.035
how many should tell you
all you need to know

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:11.137
about what it meant to me.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:12.204
(CONTINUES LAUGHING)

00:01:12.404 --> 00:01:13.673
I mean, what kind of
smack-the-ass makes

00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:16.276
an announcement like that
at his wife's funeral reception

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:17.042
anyway?

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:18.645
(LAUGHING CONTINUES)

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.281
Oh.

00:01:22.414 --> 00:01:23.817
♪ (WHIMSICAL MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:31.224
(DOORBELL RINGS)

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:38.497
Ma, what do you think?

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:40.900
I thought you were wearing
the red dress with the thing?

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:42.268
I tried, didn't work.

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.703
No, no, no. Go back
and try the red dress again.

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:45.838
(KNOCK ON DOOR)

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.307
He's at the door. Mom?

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:49.843
Oh, well, in that case,
you look great.

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:53.813
(SIGHS) Home wrecker.

00:01:57.683 --> 00:01:58.751
Holy shit.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.419
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:01.421
Bye!

